================================================================================
KEY MODIFICATIONS
================================================================================

Significant modifications and adaptations have been made to create a Claude Code
plugin that implements context-driven development methodology:

- Adaptation from Gemini CLI to Claude Code plugin architecture
- Integration with Claude Code's plugin system and MCP protocols
- Extended functionality for context-driven development workflow
- Addition of pattern reference layer and skill ecosystem
- Enhanced workflow automation and decision capture systems
- Addition of Python CLI for token-efficient operations

